      "content": "<p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000948092\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Hennur, a bustling area in Bangalore, has become one of the most sought-after locations for rentals. As it is close to tech parks, well-connected, and equipped with all the latest amenities, it is no surprise that individuals are descending upon this location. Out of all the available rentals, Kots is the epitome of a choice with regard to convenient living and comfort.<br></span></p><h2 style=\"margin: 14.94pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><br>Table of Contents</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocyaengm4fycdb\",\"id\":\"toc_5tiezq19vz8p\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_5tiezq19vz8p\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocyaengm4fycdb\",\"id\":\"toc_5tiezq19vz8p\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_5tiezq19vz8p\"> </span></b></h2><ol data-list-id=\"51470993\" data-list-format=\"{\" level5\":{\"c\":\"\\u0005.\",\"type\":2,\"startswith\":1},\"level4\":{\"c\":\"\\u0004.\",\"type\":4,\"startswith\":1},\"level7\":{\"c\":\"\\u0007.\",\"type\":4,\"startswith\":1},\"level6\":{\"c\":\"\\u0006.\",\"type\":0,\"startswith\":1},\"level8\":{\"c\":\"\\b.\",\"type\":2,\"startswith\":1},\"level1\":{\"c\":\"\\u0001.\",\"type\":7,\"startswith\":1},\"level0\":{\"c\":\"\\u0000.\",\"type\":0,\"startswith\":1},\"level3\":{\"c\":\"\\u0003.\",\"type\":0,\"startswith\":1},\"level2\":{\"c\":\"\\u0002.\",\"type\":2,\"startswith\":1}}\"=\"\" data-spl-bullet-format=\"{}\" style=\"list-style-position: initial;