"id\":\"toc_50wyqjrn1p4v\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_50wyqjrn1p4v\"><b> Apartment rentals</b><br></span></h2></h2><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-margin-top=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000948092\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><font face=\"Roboto\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Hennur has become a rental destination due to its strategic location and world-class infrastructure. That is why it's trendy:</span></font></p><p></p><h3 style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Proximity to Tech Parks</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc2qyv3x8tq0tk\",\"id\":\"toc_w3q3n7d0e0db\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_w3q3n7d0e0db\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc2qyv3x8tq0tk\",\"id\":\"toc_w3q3n7d0e0db\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_w3q3n7d0e0db\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"> </span></h3><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-margin-top=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Hennur is just a short drive away from Manyata Tech Park, so it's the ideal choice for IT professionals. The shorter commute time allows the residents to enjoy a better work-life balance.</span></p><h3 style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Excellent Connectivity</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc2r066g6xsik5\",\"id\":\"toc_8z0b1hvtyr95\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_8z0b1hvtyr95\" style=\"\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc2r066g6xsik5\",\"id\":\"toc_8z0b1hvtyr95\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_8z0b1hvtyr95\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"> </span></h3><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-margin-top=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">The location is conveniently linked to the rest of Bangalore by major roads and public transport. Whether it's to the airport or city center, Hennur guarantees a hassle-free commute.</span></p><h3 style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Abundance of Amenities</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc7epmp0wtikqz\",\"id\":\"toc_1x7xgsnxj86f\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_1x7xgsnxj86f\" style=\"\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc7epmp0wtikqz\",\"id\":\"toc_1x7xgsnxj86f\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_1x7xgsnxj86f\" style=\"\"> </span></h3><p></p><p><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocich5lr04awcm\",\"id\":\"toc_50wyqjrn1p4v\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_50wyqjrn1p4v\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">From reputed schools to multi-specialty hospitals, Hennur has everything you need for a comfortable lifestyle. Shopping centers and recreational spots add to its appeal.</span></span></p><h2><b><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000948092\" data-doc-type=\"writer\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><br>Types of Rental Options Offered by KOTS</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocnv2n2zq3nvqf\",\"id\":\"toc_1opfr5p8ijm9\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_1opfr5p8ijm9\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocnv2n2zq3nvqf\",\"id\":\"toc_1opfr5p8ijm9\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_1opfr5p8ijm9\"> <br></span></b></h2><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-margin-top=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000948092\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"font-varia